WEBVTT

1
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Hold on tight!

2
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.000
You think so? But what for?

3
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.000
These "servants of Order" live in a world way too complicated.

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.000
And I prefer simple and safe solutions!

5
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
The simpler it is, the safer, right? So let's get going!
